  "prefLabel": "Ins 3204.02 Disclosures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3204.02 Disclosures. To avoid customer confusion, in addition to the disclosures specifically required by the insurance laws of New Hampshire and the rules of the department, advertising, promotional material and solicitation shall include the disclosures required by RSA 406-C:8 to be delivered to the customer at or before the time of sale of an insurance product.\n\nSource. #7064, eff 7-24-99",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins3200.html"
}
